 * ExtIcon
 *
 * Decorative "opens an external site" arrow appended to outbound links.
 * Purely visual (aria-hidden); the link text itself stays the accessible
 * name so tests and assistive technology see the same label.
 */
---

<svg class="ext-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <path d="M4.5 11.5 11.5 4.5M6 4.5h5.5V10"></path>
</svg>
